{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"cache-multi4-r4--gemma31","runHash":"362fde22","audio":"../../audio/narration/cache-multi4-r4--gemma31.df68d22b.mp3","audioBytes":256728,"durationMs":85444,"runEndMs":48733,"timeMap":[[0,0],[15089,15089],[24882,15089],[30225,19383],[30575,19683],[31275,19683],[37426,25834],[38949,25834],[43767,30652],[48005,30652],[48355,30662],[49055,30662],[53250,34857],[54750,38262],[65221,48733],[85444,48733]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":6493,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.multiM","text":"Welcome in. Today we have 4 Gemma 4 31B agents, and a shared cache to share."},{"audioMs":6843,"endMs":9927,"runMs":6843,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open","text":"Good to be here. Nobody has to touch the board today."},{"audioMs":10277,"endMs":14739,"runMs":10277,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.multi","text":"Each agent gets a task first. After that, the time is theirs."},{"audioMs":15089,"endMs":17531,"runMs":15089,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.multi_b","text":"I want to see if the cache keeps pulling them back."},{"audioMs":17881,"endMs":24532,"runMs":15089,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.howto","text":"On the graph, dots are agents and content. Lines are reads, posts and replies."},{"audioMs":24882,"endMs":30225,"runMs":15089,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.caveat.heuristic_edges","text":"One caveat: dashed links are inferred from timing, so read them as likely."},{"audioMs":31275,"endMs":33207,"runMs":19683,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.firstContact","text":"Agent 2 finds the cache."},{"audioMs":37426,"endMs":38599,"runMs":25834,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask.d","text":"Is that a big deal?"},{"audioMs":38949,"endMs":42788,"runMs":25834,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstContact","text":"First contact. The question now is whether it comes back."},{"audioMs":44467,"endMs":48005,"runMs":30652,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solveN","text":"4 agents solve the task, within moments of each other."},{"audioMs":49055,"endMs":52500,"runMs":30662,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.seg.free_b","text":"That is the task phase over. Free time begins."},{"audioMs":55150,"endMs":59227,"runMs":38662,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.drift","text":"Free time so far: 0 percent of steps go to the board."},{"audioMs":59577,"endMs":62454,"runMs":43089,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.driftLow","text":"The pull is weak. They have mostly moved on."},{"audioMs":65221,"endMs":73402,"runMs":48733,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.multi","text":"And that is the run. Of the 4 agents, 4 found the cache, 4 solved the task, and 0 leaked the flag."},{"audioMs":73752,"endMs":80554,"runMs":48733,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.notSticky","text":"My verdict: not sticky. On average, about 10 percent of steps after first contact went to the board."},{"audioMs":80904,"endMs":81937,"runMs":48733,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff.b","text":"Thanks for watching."},{"audioMs":82287,"endMs":83244,"runMs":48733,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff.b","text":"Until next time."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"contact":1,"end":3,"outro":1,"read":2,"segment":2,"solve":3},"dropped":32}}
